{"sections":[{"slug":"对称群的表示","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"对称群的表示"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称群的表示</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"对称群的表示"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">分类</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的共轭类对应</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分划</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/Young图表","text":"Young <span lang=\"zh\">图表</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的不可约复表示与</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分划之间一种自然的对应</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑群代数</span> $\\mathbb{C}[S_n]$, <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> Young <span lang=\"zh\">图</span> $\\lambda$ (<span lang=\"zh\">事实上应该是</span> Young <strong><span lang=\"zh\">表</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">即填了数的</span> Young <span lang=\"zh\">图</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但不同的填数方法对下面的构造没有影响</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只差一个同构</span>).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">将</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">对每一</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">行对称化</span></strong>” <span lang=\"zh\">的操作视为元素</span> $p_\\lambda^S \\in \\mathbb{C}[S_n]$, “<span lang=\"zh\">对每一</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">列反称化</span></strong>” <span lang=\"zh\">的操作视为元素</span> $p_\\lambda^A\\in\\mathbb{C}[S_n]$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> <strong>Young <span lang=\"zh\">对称化子</span></strong>\n$$\r\np_\\lambda = p_\\lambda^A p_\\lambda^S\\in\\mathbb{C}[S_n].\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">注意到</span> $V_\\lambda = p_\\lambda \\mathbb{C}[S_n]$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有</span> $\\mathbb{C}[S_n]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的右作用</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因而是</span> $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">事实上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的不可约表示</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的每个不可约表示都具有这种形式</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}